---
import ResourceLayout from '../layouts/ResourceLayout.astro';
---

<ResourceLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Fulcrum Agentics"
  description="Privacy policy for Fulcrum Agentics and the Hermes Shipping Provider."
>
  <section class="site-shell resource-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: June 9, 2026</p>
  </section>

  <section class="site-shell resource-body">
    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>
      Fulcrum Agentics builds controlled operational workflows, including the
      Hermes Shipping Provider for BigCommerce. This policy explains how we
      handle information used to operate those services.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Process</h2>
    <p>
      For shipping-provider workflows, we may process checkout, cart, product,
      shipping destination, package, and rate-request details needed to return a
      shipping quote. We may also process merchant contact information when a
      merchant requests support or connects an integration.
    </p>

    <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To calculate and return shipping rates.</li>
      <li>To validate provider connection settings.</li>
      <li>To troubleshoot service errors and support merchant requests.</li>
      <li>To maintain audit logs needed for operational reliability.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We share shipping data only with service providers needed to complete the
      requested operation, such as carrier rating APIs. We do not sell merchant
      or shopper data.
    </p>

    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p>
      We retain operational logs only as long as needed for support, audit, and
      reliability purposes, unless a longer period is required by law or a
      written merchant agreement.
    </p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>
      We use access controls, environment-managed credentials, and production
      logging practices intended to limit exposure of sensitive integration
      data. Merchants should not send secrets through public support channels.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy can be sent to
      <a href="mailto:hello@fulcrumagentics.com">hello@fulcrumagentics.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</ResourceLayout>
